{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_title", "source_sha256": "8cf3e04f602f6f24fbf6fe4dbaf12500e68fe81a6ea078ed22ef21984c747648", "ja": "朋花とおでかけ1", "zh": "和朋花外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "715245c595257a7eea08a1e219c8528107b9ad40f40ca3fc6719361c3e960e7d", "ja": "朋花とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和朋花出门外出的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ba167897ef4aa8d957052cfb557a093c9a61468714369719a0013a467b1c9e6f", "ja": "（朋花の食レポの仕事は、大成功だった！\n新潟には美味しいものがたくさんあるんだな……）", "zh": "（朋花的美食介绍工作大获成功！新潟有这么多好吃的东西啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "726647584c5146fb2cf973096fa3d7424c248728cede75b8f8a88af65ca8fdfa", "ja": "（食レポの後、残った料理はスタッフで美味しく\n頂くのが鉄則だ。とはいえ、すごい量だな……）", "zh": "（美食采访结束后，剩下的料理由工作人员享用是铁则。话虽如此，这量也太惊人了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "f9b5e56829da7c273545e8d290655d1a0df22eee20854bfe800484c2f8b4efb7", "ja": "あら～？　{$P$}さん、\n先ほどから、お箸が進んでないようですが～？", "zh": "哎呀～？{$P$}先生，\n您从刚才起，筷子好像就没怎么动过呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "87e934a529acf58922de179edc7f1320e069f55c3956a8e2b9460a6dfee28b06", "ja": "朋花……このお刺身も、わっぱ飯もへぎそばも\nすごく美味しいけど、量が多すぎる気が……。", "zh": "朋花……这刺身、桶饭还有荞麦面\n都非常好吃，但感觉量有点太多了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "5c173758e04ff46fedbf33fde6bb292a3794841b196149123b5e43ed1730a3ba", "ja": "そうですね～。でも、残す……\nなんて選択肢は、ありませんよね～♪", "zh": "是啊～不过，剩下不吃……这种选项是不存在的，对吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "d79a7166bccd15e6078e43df843b9ad27565ce7d59e6ddcd3a6743652e86c207", "ja": "私は、撮影でたくさんいただいてしまいましたから～。\nご期待に沿えず、申し訳ありません～。", "zh": "我在拍摄时已经吃了很多了～。没能符合您的期待，真是抱歉～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c68278b11959aa3e0c991bc5f67684c685e64ad4506751c1b47ae98ebfa69da4", "ja": "くっ……そうだよな。こんなに美味しいんだから、\n残さず食べないと失礼だし……よし、頑張るぞ！", "zh": "呃……确实，这么好吃，不全部吃完的话也太失礼了……好，我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "e7ea0f58c97138c05f8ded29bb601d6bbaa16897de0c603053743cc136072b03", "ja": "仕方がありませんね～。では、聖母がすこしだけ、\nお手伝いをして差し上げましょう～。", "zh": "没办法呢～那么，就由圣母稍微帮帮你吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "d90428ce41efc1f7b104191ca368683a1ac3e797e6a48b55c01886d65321926b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、口を開けてください～。\n……はい、あ～ん♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请张开嘴～。\n……好，啊——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "adb5a12fb683d2597bb2e11c50d12e27845ace2ee381773db4097e9f443b29fc", "ja": "無事、完食できましたね～。\nよくできましたと、ほめてあげましょう～♪", "zh": "顺利吃完了呢～。\n来夸奖一下：“做得很好哦～♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "23f14df0b6a9fdfab3b608e904ff29226aa144b9410b968555a35aaa7dd50f1b", "ja": "（想定していた手伝いとは違ったが、\n朋花のおかげでなんとか完食できた……）", "zh": "（虽然和原本设想的帮忙不太一样，但多亏了朋花，总算是把饭全部吃完了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_031tom01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_031tom01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "325b4fec48b20f86e600a52013d1a7cbdb60f67156d621e8bc655a360e5386c6", "ja": "（これが優しさなのか厳しさなのかはわからないが……\nまあ、結果オーライだな！）", "zh": "（虽然不知道这到底算是温柔还是严格……不过结果好就行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
